{"schema_version":1,"key":"p03-no-invented-scene|skill|1","case_id":"p03-no-invented-scene","type":"write","condition":"skill","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"# 上司に怒られても、終わりではない\n\n上司に怒られると、「もう終わった」と思うかもしれない。\n\n私も新人時代には、いろいろ失敗した。それでも今、なんとか社会人として働けている。","usage":{"input_tokens":21528,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":118,"reasoning_output_tokens":49},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T04:18:38.686Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T04:18:45.105Z","duration_ms":6419}
